private RevalidationTx runRevalidationTx(handle, principal, executionId, meta, row, plan, mediaId, expectedRevision) {
   return txTemplate.execute(status -> {
      if (GIMBAL) {
         GimbalPointer p = gimbalRepository.lockById(gimbalUuid).orElseThrow(taskReplaced);
         if (p.currentAssessmentId()==null || !p.currentAssessmentId().equals(plan.assessmentId())) throw taskReplaced();
      }
      microcrystalRepository.lockById(row.microcrystalId()).orElseThrow(notVisible); // lock discipline only
      CarePlanRow lockedPlan = planRepository.lockById(plan.id()).orElseThrow(notVisible);
      if (lockedPlan.targetCount()!=null && lockedPlan.completedCount()>=lockedPlan.targetCount())
          throw executionNotResumable("plan_completed");
      CareExecutionRow locked = careExecutionRepository.lockById(executionId).orElseThrow(notVisible);
      if (!authorization.isOriginalController(principal, locked)) throw notVisible;
      if (!"paused".equals(locked.status())) throw executionNotResumable(notResumableReason(locked.status()));
      if (locked.verificationRevision() != expectedRevision) throw executionNotResumable("verification_revision_mismatch");
      if (APP) { if (!accessRepository.hasActiveGrantForUpdate(principal.accountUuid(), locked.memberId())) throw notVisible; }
      long newRevision = locked.verificationRevision()+1;
      Instant now = Instant.now();
      String latestVerification = buildRevalidationVerification(mediaId, meta, now);
      jdbc.update("UPDATE care_executions SET verification_revision=verification_revision+1,"
          + " last_verified_at=?, latest_verification=CAST(? AS jsonb),"
          + " latest_observation = CASE WHEN latest_observation IS NULL THEN NULL"
          + "   ELSE jsonb_set(latest_observation,'{continuity_invalidated}','false'::jsonb,true) END,"
          + " updated_at=now() WHERE id=?", Timestamp.from(now), latestVerification, executionId);
      jdbc.update("UPDATE media_objects SET execution_id=?, member_id=?, updated_at=now() WHERE id=?",
          executionId, locked.memberId(), mediaId);
      idempotencyService.completeSuccess(handle, "care_execution", executionId, Map.of(...));
      return new RevalidationTx(executionId, lockedPlan, locked.planSnapshot(), newRevision, now);
   });
}
```

Wait: For GIMBAL, the lock-free check uses plan.assessment_id. The final tx re-lock T03 and recheck against lockedPlan? The plan is locked after T03. We could recheck against lockedPlan.assessmentId(). Since plan.assessmentId() is fixed for the plan id, same. Use plan.assessmentId() captured. Fine.

But careful: the lock-free precheck already verified pointer current_assessment_id == plan.assessment_id. In tx we re-lock and recheck. Good.

Also note: spec says A04 final tx T04 lock "仅锁序纪律，不重检能力". We lock microcrystal by row.microcrystalId(). If it's missing → should we 404? It can't be missing due to FK. Just lock and ignore; if missing, notVisible.

